surface":"齊宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004282","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004282","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"梁惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"商君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004283","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"吳起","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004284","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0081","start":81,"end":84,"surface":"齊威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004285","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004282","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"孫子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"田忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0121","start":121,"end":123,"surface":"孟軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0125","start":125,"end":131,"surface":"唐、虞、三代","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"萬章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004288","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004289","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0168","start":168,"end":172,"surface":"騶子之屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p003","text":"齊有三騶子。其前騶忌，以鼓琴干威王，因及國政，封為成侯而受相印，先孟子。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m003-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"三騶子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m003-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"騶忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004290","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m003-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004285","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m003-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"孟子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p004","text":"其次騶衍，後孟子。騶衍睹有國者益淫侈，不能尚德，若大雅整之於身，施及黎庶矣。乃深觀陰陽消息而作怪迂之變，終始、大聖之篇十餘萬言。其語閎大不經，必先驗小物，推而大之，至於無垠。先序今以上至黃帝，學者所共術，大并世盛衰，因載其禨祥度制，推而遠之，至天地未生，窈冥不可考而原也。先列中國名山大川，通谷禽獸，水土所殖，物類所珍，因而推之，及海外人之所不能睹。稱引天地剖判以來，五德轉移，治各有宜，而符應若茲。以為儒者所謂中國者，於天下乃八十一分居其一分耳。中國名曰赤縣神州。赤縣神州內自有九州，禹之序九州是也，不得為州數。中國外如赤縣神州者九，乃所謂九州也。於是有裨海環之，人民禽獸莫能相通者，如一區中者，乃為一州。如此者九，乃有大瀛海環其外，天地之際焉。其術皆此類也。然要其歸，必止乎仁義節儉，君臣上下六親之施，始也濫耳。王公大人初見其術，懼然顧化，其後不能行之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"孟子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004292","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0166","start":166,"end":169,"surface":"海外人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0243","start":243,"end":244,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004293","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0358","start":358,"end":362,"surface":"王公大人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p005","text":"是以騶子重於齊。適梁，惠王郊迎，執賓主之禮。適趙，平原君側行撇席。如燕，昭王擁彗先驅，請列弟子之座而受業，筑碣石宮，身親往師之。作主運。其游諸侯見尊禮如此，豈與仲尼菜色陳蔡，孟軻困於齊梁同乎哉！故武王以仁義伐紂而王，伯夷餓不食周粟；衛靈公問陳，而孔子不答；梁惠王謀欲攻趙，孟軻稱大王去邠。此豈有意阿世俗茍合而已哉！持方枘欲內圜鑿，其能入乎？或曰，伊尹負鼎而勉湯以王，百里奚飯牛車下而繆公用霸，作先合，然後引之大道。騶衍其言雖不軌，儻亦有牛鼎之意乎？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"騶子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004294","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004295","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004289","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":